OL,3,ATwo senior Reform UK officials step
OL,4,Adown after undercover donations report
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo senior officials step down from
OL,7,FReform UK after a Channel 4 News report
OL,8,Fprompts the party to investigate claims
OL,9,Fabout funding
OL,11,FUndercover filming, carried out by
OL,12,FVerbatim Investigations, shows Nigel
OL,13,FFarage's senior aide Dan Jukes
OL,14,Fsuggesting a way to get around
OL,15,Felectoral law to secure a #500,000
OL,16,Fforeign donation for Reform - watch a
OL,17,Fclip
OL,19,FJukes and James Orr, the party's head
OL,20,Fof policy, have stepped down while the
OL,21,Finternal investigation takes place
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
